<Landing
  title="Free, open-source AI sound effect generator · SEGAN"
  description="Make game sound effects and music loops with your AI agent, free: no credits, no account, no cloud. SEGAN renders synth SFX and chiptune loops that match, with variations, loop points and a manifest."
